        "summary": "CO / CT / ME / MO / NY / OH physical rehab added about $0.4M, with examples in OH at about $0.1M and CT at about $62K, often with very high paid per admit in low-count cases. NY / OH / PA / VA acute hospital added about $0.3M, including Wellspan Ephrata Community Hospital at about $76K and NY cellulitis at about $92K. PA physical rehab added about $0.1M on 9 more admissions even though paid per admit fell sharply, showing a pure volume issue there. ME critical access and CT long term care hospital added about $44K and about $21K on 1 to 2 admissions."
